# The measured calibrations are deliberately NOT in the repository.
#
# There are 58 of them today and there will be thousands once every run is
# calibrated, at ~29 kB each. They are data, not code: the macros here read
# them, and fttDataWindow.C reproduces any of them from the MuDsts.
#
# Where they should live long term is not settled yet. Until it is, keep them
# in this directory locally -- fttDataWindow_db.C defaults to ./data -- or pass
# dir= to point the macro at wherever they end up.
data/
